<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Settlement Elite Emissary — buy a faction's elite troops for its special resource.
     KeySettlements: where the emissary appears (verified against TAOM_Map/settlements.xml).
     CultureOffers: keyed by the settlement's CURRENT OWNER culture (so conquest flips the offerings).
     Prices live in special_resources/troop_resource_costs.xml (merchant_cost); a troop listed here
     without a merchant_cost row is dropped + warned at load. Cultures that map to NO special resource
     (goblin, mistymountainorcs) or have no L36+ elites (dale/sturgia, dunland/empire, umbar, khand/
     battania, lothlorien) are intentionally omitted — the option won't appear there.
     See docs/features/elite-emissary.md. -->
